    rdfs:comment "DOIs, BibTeX entries, and SHA-256 digests are complete for Runions (2005), Murray (1926), Price (2013), Katifori (2012), and Ronellenfitsch (2015), though venation_reference.json says '14 canonical regimes' in the role description while listing 15 regimes. Evidence: datasets/venation/venation_reference.json L1–L165: DOIs, Table 1 regimes, and specimen SHA-256 locks <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/c89d18d/datasets/venation/venation_reference.json#L1-L165>; datasets/venation/paper_citations.bib L1–L55: BibTeX citations <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/c89d18d/datasets/venation/paper_citations.bib#L1-L55>." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-runions-leaf-venation-source-traceability> ;
    pk:hasProbability 6.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-18-venation-audit-runions-leaf-venation-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Runions et al. (2005) Leaf Venation Space-Colonization & Murray's Law — Morphological realism / specimen match: 20/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "Both specimen photographs have verified SHA-256 locks, but ginkgo_open_venation_specimen.jpg is never loaded or displayed and reticulate_vein_skeleton_specimen.jpg is only shown via imshow() with zero pixel segmentation, skeletonization, or empirical graph extraction. Evidence: 2005-runions-leaf-venation.py L72–L74: GINKGO_IMG_PATH defined but unused in v1 <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/c89d18d/2005-runions-leaf-venation.py#L72-L74>; 2005-runions-leaf-venation.py L708–L718: Panel C only calls imshow(img) on SKELETON_IMG_PATH <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/c89d18d/2005-runions-leaf-venation.py#L708-L718>." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
